# Real-Time Industrial Defect Detection System

A computer vision system for detecting industrial surface defects using YOLO, OpenCV and FastAPI.

## Project Pipeline

Camera / Image
        ↓
FastAPI Backend
        ↓
OpenCV Processing
        ↓
YOLO Detection Model
        ↓
Defect Classification
        ↓
Bounding Boxes + Confidence
        ↓
Dashboard / Sorting System

## Technologies

- Python
- FastAPI
- YOLO
- Ultralytics
- OpenCV
- NumPy
- Prometheus
- Docker

## Supported Defect Types

The project can be trained for six NEU-style surface defects:

1. Crazing
2. Inclusion
3. Patches
4. Pitted Surface
5. Rolled-in Scale
6. Scratches

